[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8101.91, "timestamp": "02:15:01", "text": "我大概一周直播两次，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8103.589, "timestamp": "02:15:03", "text": "我心想：“好了，够了。就这样吧。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8106.229, "timestamp": "02:15:06", "text": "对我来说足够了。” 不，不行。我明白"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8108.79, "timestamp": "02:15:08", "text": "这么累。就像你在直播一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8112.709, "timestamp": "02:15:12", "text": "每天都是这样，对吧？是的。每天。呃，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8115.109, "timestamp": "02:15:15", "text": "在 YouTube 上有我必须在 YouTube 上"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8117.27, "timestamp": "02:15:17", "text": "将两部分组成。第一部分和第二部分"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8120.229, "timestamp": "02:15:20", "text": "因为12小时后，YouTube不会再更新了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8123.35, "timestamp": "02:15:23", "text": "保留点播视频，对吧？它不会再是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8125.589, "timestamp": "02:15:25", "text": "值得一看。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8128.31, "timestamp": "02:15:28", "text": "是的。哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8130.629, "timestamp": "02:15:30", "text": "有趣的。正如你之前提到的那样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8133.43, "timestamp": "02:15:33", "text": "在服用期间"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8135.109, "timestamp": "02:15:35", "text": "比如休息时间，或者喜欢吃东西等等"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8136.709, "timestamp": "02:15:36", "text": "东西，你正在放一个花苞，是吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8139.589, "timestamp": "02:15:39", "text": "那也像是要被录下来一样，还是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8142.629, "timestamp": "02:15:42", "text": "你喜欢把它分成两半吗？哦，是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8145.669, "timestamp": "02:15:45", "text": "就像我做过的所有直播一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8148.87, "timestamp": "02:15:48", "text": "我的频道，呃，都在YouTube上，全部"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8152.47, "timestamp": "02:15:52", "text": "就是那件事。呃，我把它做成了这样，这样它就能得到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8156.47, "timestamp": "02:15:56", "text": "从随机时间戳中随机抽取一个 v。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8159.75, "timestamp": "02:15:59", "text": "嗯，那是以前的配置。然后我"}]